  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="index.html#experiences">Off-beat escapes</a> / Northern Kenya Desert Safari</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Few Kenyans, let alone visitors, ever reach the far north — and that is exactly the point. This is a true expedition to the edge of the map: the jade-green waters of Lake Turkana, the shimmering Chalbi Desert, palm oases and the proud cultures of the frontier.</p>
        <p>Raw, remote and unforgettable, flown in to save the long roads. For the genuinely adventurous who've "done" the usual parks and want something else entirely.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
