  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your expedition</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to the Jade Sea</h3><p>A spectacular flight north to Lake Turkana, the world's largest desert lake. Settle into a lodge on the shore at Loiyangalani and watch the wind whip the jade water at dusk.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Turkana shore lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Turkana &amp; the El Molo</h3><p>A boat onto the lake and a visit to the El Molo, one of Africa's smallest peoples, then the singing wells and desert oases of the surrounding frontier.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Turkana shore lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Across the Chalbi Desert</h3><p>Strike out across the vast Chalbi Desert — mirage and salt-pan, camel caravans and the green oasis of Kalacha — for a night under an enormous, star-filled sky.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Desert camp / Kalacha · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly home</h3><p>A final desert dawn, then the long, beautiful flight back south over a Kenya few ever see.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
